.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-DECK 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-deck \- Configure and enroll the Decision Deck
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu deck\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure and enroll the Decision Deck
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-deck\-configure(1)
Configure the Decision Deck scope (starts disabled)
.TP
quipu\-deck\-enroll(1)
Enroll a Decision Deck credential
.TP
quipu\-deck\-enable(1)
Enable the Decision Deck
.TP
quipu\-deck\-disable(1)
Disable the Decision Deck
.TP
quipu\-deck\-revoke(1)
Revoke a Decision Deck credential
.TP
quipu\-deck\-status(1)
Show Decision Deck configuration and state
.TP
quipu\-deck\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
